    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995080/extras/afb864c9fb2dddde92f710038b64e6f9.avif?t=1750387789\" width=600 height=92 /></span><br><br>Once the game starts, players are thrown into an arena. In the arena, three-colored slimes will continuously drop, and the players' task is to arrange three slimes of the same color to eliminate them and score points. This part of the game mechanics is inspired by classic match-three games.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995080/extras/8fe157cd1643a414a1a9b91d137ec060.poster.avif?t=1750387789\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995080/extras/8fe157cd1643a414a1a9b91d137ec060.webm?t=1750387789\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995080/extras/8fe157cd1643a414a1a9b91d137ec060.mp4?t=1750387789\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Players can also brawl with each other in the arena to reduce their opponents' scores.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995080/extras/c8aafab8cabb2c70e20471ceb726703b.poster.avif?t=1750387789\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995080/extras/c8aafab8cabb2c70e20471ceb726703b.webm?t=1750387789\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995080/extras/c8aafab8cabb2c70e20471ceb726703b.mp4?t=1750387789\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995080/extras/1e624e8e1f93341dce8f04fec00de5ae.avif?t=1750387789\" width=600 height=92 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Combination of Match-Three and Action:</strong> Combines match-three gameplay with multiplayer brawling, creating a unique and engaging party game experience.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Easy to Learn:</strong> Simple game rules and intuitive controls make it easy to understand.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Fast-Paced Experience:</strong> Each game session is short, making it perfect for quick entertainment.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995080/extras/5cbae569671828050c6b49eb99065659.poster.avif?t=1750387789\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995080/extras/5cbae569671828050c6b49eb99065659.webm?t=1750387789\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995080/extras/5cbae569671828050c6b49eb99065659.mp4?t=1750387789\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995080/extras/afb864c9fb2dddde92f710038b64e6f9.avif?t=1750387789\" width=600 height=92 /></span><br><br>Once the game starts, players are thrown into an arena. In the arena, three-colored slimes will continuously drop, and the players' task is to arrange three slimes of the same color to eliminate them and score points. This part of the game mechanics is inspired by classic match-three games.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995080/extras/8fe157cd1643a414a1a9b91d137ec060.poster.avif?t=1750387789\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995080/extras/8fe157cd1643a414a1a9b91d137ec060.webm?t=1750387789\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995080/extras/8fe157cd1643a414a1a9b91d137ec060.mp4?t=1750387789\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Players can also brawl with each other in the arena to reduce their opponents' scores.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995080/extras/c8aafab8cabb2c70e20471ceb726703b.poster.avif?t=1750387789\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995080/extras/c8aafab8cabb2c70e20471ceb726703b.webm?t=1750387789\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995080/extras/c8aafab8cabb2c70e20471ceb726703b.mp4?t=1750387789\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995080/extras/1e624e8e1f93341dce8f04fec00de5ae.avif?t=1750387789\" width=600 height=92 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Combination of Match-Three and Action:</strong> Combines match-three gameplay with multiplayer brawling, creating a unique and engaging party game experience.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Easy to Learn:</strong> Simple game rules and intuitive controls make it easy to understand.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Fast-Paced Experience:</strong> Each game session is short, making it perfect for quick entertainment.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995080/extras/5cbae569671828050c6b49eb99065659.poster.avif?t=1750387789\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995080/extras/5cbae569671828050c6b49eb99065659.webm?t=1750387789\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995080/extras/5cbae569671828050c6b49eb99065659.mp4?t=1750387789\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
